    "result_text": "The change is complete and the test passes (`1 passed`).\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented per-project task lists that can be ticked off, as a small additive full-stack change:\n\n**Database** \u2014 `V11__tasks.sql`: new `tasks` table (`id`, `project_id` FK \u2192 projects, `title`, `done` boolean).\n\n**Server (OfficeFloor + Spring)**\n- `Task.java` \u2014 record serialized to JSON.\n- `TaskRepository.java` \u2014 `findByProject`, `findById`, `setDone`, `create` via `JdbcTemplate`.\n- `TasksGetLogic.java` + `rest/api/tasks.GET.yml` \u2014 `GET /api/tasks?projectId=<id>`.\n- `TasksTogglePostLogic.java` + `ToggleTask.java` + `rest/api/tasks/toggle.POST.yml` \u2014 `POST /api/tasks/toggle` flips `done` and records an audit line (`TASK_DONE`/`TASK_REOPENED id=<id>`) through the `Audit` service.\n- `TestSupportController.java` \u2014 extended `/__test__/reset` to `TRUNCATE ... RESTART IDENTITY` the `tasks` table (before `projects`, its FK parent) and `/__test__/seed` to insert `tasks` rows by explicit fixture id via `JdbcTemplate`.\n\n**Front-end (React)**\n- `features/projects/ProjectTasks.tsx` \u2014 a new component owning its own state that lists a project's tasks in `project-tasks-table`, showing `task-title` and `task-status` (`OPEN`/`DONE`) per `task-row-<id>`, with a `task-toggle-<id>` button that calls the toggle endpoint.\n- `ProjectsPage.tsx` \u2014 renders `ProjectTasks` (alongside the existing `ProjectInvoices`) when a project is opened.\n\nAll the `data-testid` anchors match the spec exactly, and no pinned scaffolding, CLAUDE.md, or the test spec were modified.",
